  "notes": "Contributing cause: RC system was being run at elevated temperature for main turbine overspeed testing, which reduced condenser vacuum margin and was implemented in parallel with actions to lower RC temperature without adequate assessment of combined impact -- captured in cause theme/proximate_text but not modeled as a separate Cause node since block-13/cause_code is singular (D). No BACKED_UP_BY edges emitted: AFW/RPS actuation are the consequence itself, not backups, and no system was stated as an operable backup during the inoperability window. Four prior LERs referenced as previous occurrences per report; none share the same causal factors per the licensee, but are captured as stub SIMILAR_TO nodes per instructions since they are explicitly listed as related reactor-trip events at the plant."
